#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""
btc5m_daxue_live.py — Polymarket BTC 5m 「大数投资」DAXUE live strategy

Translate 齐东平 A-share 大数投资 principles into BTC 5m binary:
  1. Low cost / 低估值: BUY only when ask ∈ [ASK_MIN, ASK_MAX] (default 0.22–0.40)
  2. Side from spot vs window open (UP if spot>open+tol, DOWN if spot<open-tol)
  3. 大数 diversify: ≤1 new entry per 5m window; max concurrent cost ≤ floor(2/3*bankroll)
  4. Hold to settlement — no mid-window sell
  5. 永续/逆向 light: never chase ask > ASK_MAX
  6. Post-window BUY banned (left<=0 or now>=market_end)
  7. Hard BUY cap: place_order market buy with maxPrice=decision_ask+slip (FOK)

Does NOT restart / depend on GUIDED_LIVE lag+SR filters.
Orders via node place_order.mjs (POLY_1271 OWNER path). Never prints private keys.

TODO(oracle/reviews): agent reviews that settle via "next 5m window open vs this
window open" can disagree with Polymarket's Chainlink/oracle settle; prefer
gamma/market closed outcome or CLOB trade redemption when reviewing PnL.
"""

